            </div>
            <div class="modal-body row">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p id="serviceModalDescription">We deliver end-to-end B2B e-commerce solutions to help businesses streamline transactions, enhance customer experiences, and accelerate growth. From platform development to integration with ERP systems, our expertise ensures your online business runs efficiently and scales seamlessly with market demands.</p>
                    <ul id="serviceModalPoints">
                        <li>
                            • Tailored B2B Solutions
                        </li>
                        <li>• Seamless ERP Integrations</li>
                        <li>• Scalable Architecture</li>
                        <li>• Enhanced Customer Experience</li>
                        <li>• Secure Payment & Logistics Integration</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                    <img id="serviceModalImage" src="~/assets/images/SapImage.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Service Image" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

